"""Golden fixture code generator (ADR-0010 / docs/coverage-matrix.md frozen v1).

Pipeline:
 1. Parse the frozen coverage matrix (docs/coverage-matrix.md) into required
    cells (feature x protocol -> minimum case count).
 2. Emit the minimal case set defined below into fixtures/cases/*.json
    (schema taprint/golden-case@1) and assemble fixtures/manifest.json.
 3. Verify every non-"-" cell is covered by the stated count, the four
    mandatory special cases exist, and identity-fn cases are L1-only.
 4. Drive the Java reference renderer (packages/taprint-java) to regenerate
    fixtures/expected/commands/<case>/java/{<protocol>.frames.txt,
    <protocol>.bytes.sha256}.

Run from the repository root:
    tools/fixture-codegen [--skip-java] [--l2-green ts=case1,case2,...]

The --l2-green flag stamps manifest l2Assert.<lang>=true for the listed
cases (languages whose byte streams currently match the Java reference);
java is always true. CS/Dart start false until their runners are enabled.
"""
